# party-inheritance — party resolution along a three-link principal chain (§6, §9):
# mgr declares none and resolves through to ceo's corp; sub's declared ops wins
# over the chain; bot declares none and takes the NEAREST declared party (sub's
# ops, not ceo's corp). The observation projects each resolved party on its node.
actor ceo party corp
actor mgr on-behalf-of ceo
actor sub on-behalf-of mgr party ops
actor bot on-behalf-of sub
gate g risk low grant ceo[deploy:low] mgr[deploy:low] sub[deploy:low] bot[deploy:low]
cord g -> master
